# Keyboard input QA script
# Regression check that the existing menu behaves identically after the input
# rewrite: arrows still move, W/S still alias to up/down in either case now
# that they arrive as characters, Esc is still ignored on the menu, and Enter
# and Esc still move between screens. Menu order is New Game, Options, Quit,
# wrapping at both ends. The run starts on New Game.

Down    # New Game -> Options
Down    # Options -> Quit
Down    # Quit -> New Game (wraps)
Up      # New Game -> Quit (wraps)
s       # Quit -> New Game (lowercase s is down, wraps)
S       # New Game -> Options (uppercase S is down)
w       # Options -> New Game (lowercase w is up)
W       # New Game -> Quit (uppercase W is up, wraps)
Down    # Quit -> New Game (wraps)
Esc     # ignored on the main menu: logs the key and no event
Enter   # New Game opens the map screen
Esc     # back to the menu, New Game still selected
